Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fix social media icons not rendering despite data present

- Add App\Support\PublicSocialMedia: single source of truth for layout
  social rows; tolerant is_active match (0/1/'0'/'1'), drops NULL AND
  empty/whitespace URLs, normalizes icon_key (trim + lowercase).
- AppServiceProvider composer now uses the helper; marketplace button
  grouping keyed by normalized icon_key so 'TOKOPEDIA'/' Shopee ' rows
  are recognized.
- partials/social-icon.blade.php matches built-in SVGs against the
  normalized key (was strict case-sensitive ===), and treats whitespace
  icon_url as empty.
- SettingsController normalizes url/icon_url/icon_key on save so future
  edits can't reintroduce dirty values.
- New migration normalizes legacy social_media rows (empty strings ->
  NULL, mixed-case keys -> lowercase, is_active cast to 0/1).

Run  then  and
 on the server.
